{"ticker":"UAL","updated":"2026-10-30T23:19:17Z","profile":{"longName":"United Airlines Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"United Airlines Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airlines","country":"United States","website":"https://www.united.com","fullTimeEmployees":117900,"marketCap":33866987520,"trailingPE":9.545787,"forwardPE":8.707448,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.51663524,"pegRatio":6.5,"targetMeanPrice":150.08696,"targetHighPrice":203.0,"targetLowPrice":98.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.174,"earningsGrowth":0.083,"grossMargins":0.30868,"operatingMargins":0.07032,"profitMargins":0.054569997,"totalRevenue":65552998400,"beta":1.304,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":138.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":84.64,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"United Airlines Holdings, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides air transportation services in the United States, Canada, Atlantic, the Pacific, and Latin America. It transports people and cargo through its mainline and regional fleets. The company also offers ground handling, flight academy, frequent flyer award non-travel redemptions, and maintenance services for third parties. In addition, it provides freight and mail transportation services to commercial businesses, freight forwarders, logistics firms, and national postal services, as well as loyalty programs. The company distributes its products through direct channels, such as the Company's website and the Company's mobile app; and traditional travel agencies, online travel agencies, and other intermediaries. The company was formerly known as United Continental Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to United Airlines Holdings, Inc. in June 2019. United Airlines Holdings, Inc. was incorporated in 1968 and is based in Chicago, Illinois.","summary_zh":"聯合航空控股公司透過其子公司在美國、加拿大、大西洋、太平洋和拉丁美洲提供航空運輸服務。它透過其乾線和支線船隊運輸人員和貨物。該公司還提供地面服務、飛行學院、飛行常客獎勵非旅行兌換以及第三方維護服務。此外，它還為商業企業、貨運代理、物流公司和國家郵政服務以及忠誠度計劃提供貨運和郵件運輸服務。公司透過直接管道分銷其產品，例如公司網站和公司行動應用程式；以及傳統旅行社、線上旅行社等中介機構。該公司前身為 United Continental Holdings, Inc.，於 2019 年 6 月更名為 United Airlines Holdings, Inc.。 United Airlines Holdings, Inc. 成立於 1968 年，總部位於伊利諾州芝加哥。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":102.99,"h":104.77,"l":101.75,"c":104.68,"v":7055000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":105.1,"h":109.69,"l":104.93,"c":106.16,"v":5783900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":106.1,"h":109.3,"l":105.41,"c":106.05,"v":5044200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":106.44,"h":107.61,"l":105.29,"c":106.59,"v":3634100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":107.48,"h":109.44,"l":106.21,"c":107.77,"v":5219200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":107.42,"h":107.91,"l":103.97,"c":105.65,"v":5259500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":105.98,"h":108.14,"l":105.31,"c":107.51,"v":5245300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":108.94,"h":110.66,"l":105.06,"c":109.36,"v":8182600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":108.95,"h":109.57,"l":106.5,"c":106.58,"v":6077800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":106.65,"h":106.82,"l":103.31,"c":104.55,"v":4722000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":104.5,"h":105.24,"l":102.1,"c":104.2,"v":4989400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":104.58,"h":108.15,"l":104.19,"c":105.51,"v":4918200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":106.48,"h":107.2,"l":105.02,"c":105.38,"v":4302200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":105.72,"h":106.7,"l":103.85,"c":106.31,"v":11193200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":105.88,"h":105.96,"l":101.25,"c":104.18,"v":6791700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":104.24,"h":106.5,"l":103.99,"c":104.13,"v":4071600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":104.71,"h":104.71,"l":100.92,"c":101.39,"v":5796900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":99.85,"h":100.77,"l":98.57,"c":99.15,"v":4082600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":100.34,"h":101.05,"l":97.77,"c":97.91,"v":5310700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":99.89,"h":100.22,"l":96.35,"c":98.64,"v":6437100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":98.64,"h":99.19,"l":94.81,"c":96.5,"v":5646100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":95.99,"h":96.51,"l":93.06,"c":93.15,"v":6303000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":93.64,"h":95.4,"l":92.9,"c":94.83,"v":4153200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":95.4,"h":95.97,"l":94.17,"c":95.33,